import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 740 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Quantification of Hang-Up Retirement's Energy Waste","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 740 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Quantification of Hang-Up Retirement's Energy Waste","no":740,"module":4,"tags":["Critique of Hang-Up Retirement","Energy Waste","Quantification","Civilizational Weight","Alaya Network"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","29-Symbiosis-Degree-Assessment System","15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0740_模块4-挂机养老批判-能级浪费量化.md","filePath":"en/0740_模块4-挂机养老批判-能级浪费量化.md"}`),o={name:"en/0740_模块4-挂机养老批判-能级浪费量化.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,c,h){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-740-critique-of-hang-up-retirement-quantification-of-hang-up-retirement-s-energy-waste" tabindex="-1">Entry 740 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Quantification of Hang-Up Retirement&#39;s Energy Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-740-critique-of-hang-up-retirement-quantification-of-hang-up-retirement-s-energy-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 740 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Quantification of Hang-Up Retirement&#39;s Energy Waste&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 29, 15</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-calculate-how-much-lying-flat-actually-costs" tabindex="-1">Introduction: calculate how much &quot;lying flat&quot; actually costs <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-calculate-how-much-lying-flat-actually-costs" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: calculate how much &quot;lying flat&quot; actually costs&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The previous entries critiquing hang-up retirement used qualitative language — &quot;waste,&quot; &quot;reversal,&quot; &quot;vacuum.&quot; But Heng Yuan Zhou is a civilization that believes in quantification: any critique that cannot be measured easily becomes a slogan. What this entry does is <strong>calculate</strong> hang-up retirement&#39;s energy waste — a Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm-level strong one choosing to hang up, exactly how much civilizational increment is wasted? If those increments were invested in perpetual construction, how many beings would benefit?</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are the quantifying coordinate system: the anti-predation axiom requires stripping predatory output off the ledger; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires counting allocation coverage into the denominator; the collective ascension axiom requires counting collective-uplift rate into the numerator; the causal self-discipline axiom requires counting cross-plane disturbance&#39;s hidden cost into expenditure; the law-first axiom requires the whole quantifying model itself be law-self-consistent and never eat its own book.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-quantification-model-s-basic-parameters" tabindex="-1">I. The Quantification Model&#39;s Basic Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-quantification-model-s-basic-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Quantification Model&#39;s Basic Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou uses &quot;Civilizational Weight Net&quot; (CW Net) as the core measurement unit. A high-position strong one&#39;s CW Net has four components:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th><th>Weight</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Power output</td><td>P</td><td>His computable power&#39;s actual contribution to the law network</td><td>40%</td></tr><tr><td>Heart-nature calibration</td><td>M</td><td>His stabilizing contribution to Myriad Ranks&#39; psychology and causality</td><td>25%</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge openness</td><td>K</td><td>His manuals and law-weaving&#39;s network-wide openness</td><td>20%</td></tr><tr><td>Responsibility bearing</td><td>R</td><td>His fulfillment of civilizational engineering and cross-plane duties</td><td>15%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>CW Net = (P×0.4 + M×0.25 + K×0.2 + R×0.15) × civilizational consensus degree. Civilizational consensus degree is a coefficient between 0 and 1, derived by Myriad-Rank representative vote + Alaya Network automatic computation.</p><p>A normally on-post Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm strong one&#39;s CW Net is usually on the order of 10^12. If he chooses to hang up, what we calculate is the whole process by which this number falls from full to zero.</p><h2 id="ii-four-component-decay-under-hang-up" tabindex="-1">II. Four-Component Decay Under Hang-Up <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-four-component-decay-under-hang-up" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Four-Component Decay Under Hang-Up&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Take a standard Balanced-Anchor-level strong one; assume his peak CW Net is 100 (normalized unit):</p><p><strong>Power output P decay</strong>: after hanging up, his computable power no longer goes into law calibration; P falls from 40 to 5 (residual passive influence). Loss: 35.</p><p><strong>Heart-nature calibration M decay</strong>: after hanging up, his stabilizing effect on Myriad Ranks&#39; psychological field vanishes; M falls from 25 to 3. Loss: 22.</p><p><strong>Knowledge openness K decay</strong>: after hanging up, no new manuals or new laws are produced, and old manuals also stop maintenance updates; K falls from 20 to 8 (existing knowledge still there, but no longer iterating). Loss: 12.</p><p><strong>Responsibility bearing R decay</strong>: after hanging up, civilizational-engineering duties are all transferred or shelved; R falls from 15 to 0. Loss: 15.</p><p><strong>Total</strong>: 100 falls to 16; a single individual&#39;s CW Net loss is 84. This is only direct loss.</p><h2 id="iii-indirect-loss-the-vacuum-s-chain-cost" tabindex="-1">III. Indirect Loss: The Vacuum&#39;s Chain Cost <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-indirect-loss-the-vacuum-s-chain-cost" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Indirect Loss: The Vacuum&#39;s Chain Cost&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Direct loss is only the tip of the iceberg. The larger bill is indirect loss:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Indirect Item</th><th>Computation</th><th>Loss Estimate</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Law-drift repair cost</td><td>Star-sector law disorder after losing anchor; computable power needed for repair</td><td>About 2.3× direct loss</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge-discontinuity delay</td><td>Time-cost折算 of later-comers taking detours</td><td>About 1.8× direct loss</td></tr><tr><td>Predatory-faction fill cost</td><td>Clearance cost after the vacuum is occupied by predators</td><td>About 4.7× direct loss</td></tr><tr><td>Beings&#39; confidence loss</td><td>Strong-one hang-up causing Myriad Ranks to lose confidence in civilization</td><td>Hard to quantify but extremely high</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Per Alaya Network historical data backtesting, a Balanced-Anchor-level strong one hanging up has <strong>total indirect loss about 8 to 12 times direct loss</strong>. That is, nominally he only &quot;wasted&quot; his own computable power, but actually the civilizational-repair cost he creates is more than eight times his on-post output.</p><p>This is hang-up retirement&#39;s true price: <strong>not how much less you did, but how many times the price others pay after you leave to clean up the mess you left.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-comparison-on-post-output" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison: On-Post Output <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-on-post-output" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison: On-Post Output&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Inversely, if the same strong one chooses perpetual construction, his CW Net not only does not decay, but grows over time:</p><ul><li>Year 1: CW Net 100, invests in new-manual R&amp;D; K grows;</li><li>Year 100: CW Net 150, the 100 successors he cultivated each produce; K compound-grows;</li><li>Year 10,000: CW Net 1000, his law-weaving becomes star-sector public infrastructure; P compound-grows;</li><li>Year 1,000,000: CW Net 10^6, the cross-cosmos anchor network he participates in begins producing exponential increments.</li></ul><p>The on-post vs. hang-up gap is not linear, but a <strong>compound vs. decay</strong> exponential gap. After 100 million years, the on-post one&#39;s CW Net may be 10^12 times the hang-up one&#39;s — not because he grew stronger, but because the hang-up one was in debt from day one, while the on-post one was compounding from day one.</p><h2 id="v-quantification-conclusion-hang-up-is-a-negative-sum-game" tabindex="-1">V. Quantification Conclusion: Hang-Up Is a Negative-Sum Game <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quantification-conclusion-hang-up-is-a-negative-sum-game" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quantification Conclusion: Hang-Up Is a Negative-Sum Game&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Summing direct and indirect losses, Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s quantifying conclusion is very clear:</p><blockquote><p><strong>A Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm strong one choosing hang-up retirement, his net contribution to civilization changes from positive infinity to negative infinity — he not only stops positive output, but also creates continuously amplifying negative cost through the causal chain.</strong></p></blockquote><p>This is not moral condemnation; this is accounting. In the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle, every high-position individual&#39;s CW Net is public asset. You may choose not to work, but you may not choose &quot;not working yet not producing cost&quot; — because once you leave, the vacuum is there, predators are there, the repair cost is there.</p><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: this entry uses math to prove hang-up retirement&#39;s energy waste is not &quot;did less,&quot; but &quot;did negative&quot; — total loss is 8 to 12 times direct loss</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the vacuum the hang-upper creates is ultimately filled by predators; his negative cost is essentially subsidizing the predatory system</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s gift-style monopolization manifests in the CW model as K component negative (knowledge locked); hang-up retirement&#39;s K component only decays rather than goes negative, but stacked with indirect loss it is worse</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the CW Net&#39;s civilizational-consensus-degree coefficient is decided by Myriad-Rank vote; the hang-upper&#39;s consensus degree keeps declining over time, finally zeroing</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: this quantifying model itself is a hyper-multiverse-grade public tool, open through the Selfless Dao to all planes, for local civilizations to audit hang-up cost on their own</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Hang-up retirement is not &quot;taking a break,&quot; but writing a huge check on civilization&#39;s balance sheet — the strong one signs, Myriad Ranks pay. Heng Yuan Zhou refuses this check: every unit of Balanced-Anchor-level computable power must be on post, not because we forbid rest, but because <strong>Myriad Ranks cannot afford the price of rest.</strong></p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/29-共生度评估体系.html">Entry 29 · Symbiosis-Degree-Assessment System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">Entry 15 · Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic Feedback-Cycle Mechanism</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',38)])])}const p=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
